WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.730
A trumpet sounds.

2
00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:05.850
All that are in the heavens
and on earth fall into a swoon.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.400
Then, the Qur'an says,
a second one is sounded,

4
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.310
and they will be standing and looking on.

5
00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.970
Muslims believe each person
lives one earthly life.

6
00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.720
There is no rebirth.

7
00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:20.660
What follows is a journey in stages.

8
00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:24.530
So what happens at each stage,
and why should it matter now?

9
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.900
In this mission, you'll follow
the journey step by step,

10
00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:30.710
to the record of deeds and the balance.

11
00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.630
Then you'll read how the
Qur'an pictures paradise,

12
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.720
with rivers of water, milk and honey.

13
00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:41.920
Your mission: find out what Muslims
believe happens at each stage after death,

14
00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:43.810
and why it shapes life now.
